  "items": [
   {
    "segment": "seg01",
    "start": 7.0,
    "end": 11.0,
    "text": "I kept this close,\nso close to my *heart*"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg02",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 0.82,
    "text": "I kept this close,\nso close to my *heart*"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg04",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 2.7,
    "text": "Every evening I\ncome home *smiling*"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg05",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 3.8,
    "text": "And I set my face\nlike *nothing's wrong*"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg06",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 3.12,
    "text": "You ask me, how\nwas your day, *ji*?"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg07",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 3.05,
    "text": "And I say *fine*, though\nI know it's not"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg08",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 3.34,
    "text": "There is a *room*\ninside my chest"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg09",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 3.2,
    "text": "Where I keep the\nwords I *never said*"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg10",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 3.35,
    "text": "I wanted *peace*,\nI wanted time"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg11",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 3.97,
    "text": "I thought the *truth*\ncould wait a while"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg12",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 3.7,
    "text": "But the *silence*\nhas a way tonight"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg13",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 3.5,
    "text": "And it follows me\nfrom *room to room*"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg14",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 4.04,
    "text": "I stand at the *edge*\nof my own reply"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg15",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 1.8,
    "text": "*Afraid* of what\ncomes into view"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg16",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 2.12,
    "text": "*Afraid* of what\ncomes into view"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg17",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 3.8,
    "text": "I'm just *tired*, ji"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg18",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 3.81,
    "text": "Tired of holding\nwhat I *can't undo*"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg19",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 2.64,
    "text": "I'm just *tired*, ji"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg20",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 3.2,
    "text": "Tired of *pretending*\nI can choose"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg21",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 3.44,
    "text": "As you hear my voice\n*shake* a little"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg22",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 3.62,
    "text": "It's because I'm\n*finally* letting through"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg23",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 2.7,
    "text": "I'm just *tired*, ji"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg24",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 2.46,
    "text": "And I need you\nto *see me true*"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg25",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 2.8,
    "text": "And I need you\nto *see me true*"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg29",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 1.15,
    "text": "You found a *letter*\non the table"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg30",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 1.83,
    "text": "You found a *letter*\non the table"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg30",
    "start": 1.83,
    "end": 5.05,
    "text": "And the *colour*\nleft your face"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg31",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 3.45,
    "text": "I saw the *hurt*\nbefore the question"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg31",
    "start": 3.45,
    "end": 6.7,
    "text": "It was standing\nin the *space*"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg32",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 3.35,
    "text": "I meant to *tell you*\nin the morning"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg32",
    "start": 3.35,
    "end": 6.47,
    "text": "But my *courage*\nfailed again"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg33",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 3.45,
    "text": "Now the *truth*\nis in the light"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg34",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 4.83,
    "text": "And I cannot *hide*\nfrom it, my friend"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg35",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 0.36,
    "text": "And I cannot *hide*\nfrom it, my friend"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg36",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 4.8,
    "text": "I never meant to\nbreak your *trust*"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg37",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 3.25,
    "text": "I never meant\nto *turn away*"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg37",
    "start": 3.25,
    "end": 5.52,
    "text": "But carrying\nthis *alone*"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg38",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 2.86,
    "text": "has worn my *voice* away"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg39",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 4.18,
    "text": "I'm just *tired*, ji"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg40",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 3.49,
    "text": "Tired of living\n*half a life*"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg41",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 3.15,
    "text": "I'm just *tired*, ji"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg42",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 3.26,
    "text": "Tired of cutting\ntruth to *size*"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg43",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 3.54,
    "text": "If my eyes look like\nthey are *begging*"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg43",
    "start": 3.54,
    "end": 4.64,
    "text": "It's because I don't\nknow how to *lie*"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg44",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 2.77,
    "text": "It's because I don't\nknow how to *lie*"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg45",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 2.73,
    "text": "I'm just *tired*, ji"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg45",
    "start": 2.73,
    "end": 7.83,
    "text": "Please *hear me* before\nwe say goodbye"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg46",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 0.42,
    "text": "Please *hear me* before\nwe say goodbye"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg47",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 4.13,
    "text": "Maybe *love* can\nhold the fracture"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg48",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 3.3,
    "text": "Maybe *truth* can\nlet us stay"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg49",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 3.19,
    "text": "If we walk through\nthis *together*"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg50",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 3.98,
    "text": "We may find\na *kinder* way"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg51",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 3.72,
    "text": "I'm just *tired*, ji"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg52",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 3.7,
    "text": "But I am still\nhere by *your side*"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg52",
    "start": 4.18,
    "end": 6.81,
    "text": "I'm just *tired*, ji"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg53",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 3.39,
    "text": "And I wanna\n*make this right*"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg54",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 3.46,
    "text": "If you can *hold my hand*\nfor one more moment"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg55",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 3.94,
    "text": "We can learn to\n*breathe* again tonight"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg55",
    "start": 3.94,
    "end": 6.75,
    "text": "I'm just *tired*, ji"
   },
   {
    "segment": "seg56",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 5.17,
    "text": "Stay with me now,\nlet us *begin again*"
   }
